": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225575144", "author": {"steamid": "76561198345215888", "personaname": "M_o_n_s_t_e_R", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198345215888/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 17226, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5485, "last_played": 1781159193, "avatar": "6c75bb42a0e4ad9b6e0cddf285e14f0fbf4ac4e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "More Fun If You Have Someone To Play With", "timestamp_created": 1778858775, "timestamp_updated": 1778858775, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225511720", "author": {"steamid": "76561199163417933", "personaname": "Outlaw Mugen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199163417933/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 187, "playtime_forever": 776, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 402, "last_played": 1779640995, "avatar": "70cbd480e6e71cd5381ac61f4ac772663edee4c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game can be fun BUT...\r\n\r\n- Bosses are cheaters. Many times their AOE hits faster than the animations or leave no free safe space to stand on. All that while being attacked by random flying bullets, smaller mobs or dangerous areas. The last battle ship and a sand worm are the worst. \r\n\r\n- Even though the layouts of the maps are randomized you are still going through SAME LOCATIONS OVER AND OVER AGAIN. Tombs>Desert>Catfish Groove or whatever you want to call it. This does get tedious. \r\n\r\n- Some characters are SIMPLY BETTER THAN OTHERS. Period. \r\n\r\n- Some weapons are useless. Like completely useless. Mortar and basic sniper comes to mind. Slow and low damage. There are better \"cannons\" or sniper weapons out there like frozen spear that simply outdamage the former. \r\n\r\n- There is no \"SAVE\" option in the middle of the RUN. You have to complete it. Which is a shame as one of our friend had to go and we forfeit the run in the middle. It would be nice to be able to save after each boss at the rest area. Some games offer that much. \r\n\r\nBase game price is too much considering all the DLC's ( weapons and characters locked behind a paywall. Again some of them are pretty good ). \r\n\r\nRecommend only on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1778796328, "timestamp_updated": 1778796328, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.536053121089935303", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225509671", "author": {"steamid": "76561198446781196", "personaname": "melonendrache", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198446781196/", "num_games_owned": 126, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4671, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4591, "last_played": 1779115967, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love the Insane DMG Numbers you can get and the fact that you can play the Modi of old Seasons. Also the Variety of Weapons and the Different Builds you can do with each Character adds a lot of Depth to the Gameplay. Overall definitely a game I would recommend playing with Friends though it is still good fun Solo.", "timestamp_created": 1778794643, "timestamp_updated": 1778794643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}